          <p>MEAICON is a vendor-neutral engineering consulting firm focused on critical infrastructure, data centres, and building services — mechanical, electrical, and plumbing (MEP). We help organisations design, implement, and optimise high-availability facilities that support business-critical IT and operational workloads.</p>
          <p>Our team brings regional and international experience across multiple industries, with a strong emphasis on reliability, efficiency, scalability, and security. By staying independent from equipment manufacturers, builders, and contractors, we ensure that every recommendation serves the client's interests — not a supplier's pipeline.</p>
