          <h3>Certification Readiness &amp; Standards Alignment</h3>
          <p>Upon completion of new or upgraded facilities, organisations need assurance that their data centres conform to applicable design and operations standards. We perform readiness assessments to validate that infrastructure has been implemented in line with relevant requirements and best practices. Our assessments focus on practical conformity that supports reliable, safe, and efficient operations.</p>
          <h3>Operations Standards &amp; Risk Assessment</h3>
          <p>We assist service providers and enterprise operators in developing robust data centre operations standards — covering processes, roles, maintenance practices, and documentation needed to sustain high availability over the long term. Our risk assessments evaluate the current state of data centre implementations and operational practices, identifying technical, environmental, and procedural risks that may affect performance or availability.</p>
          <h3>Audit, Optimisation &amp; Training Support</h3>
          <p>For organisations seeking deeper validation, we coordinate or perform detailed audits of facilities against defined criteria and disciplines. These audits give stakeholders confidence that infrastructure and operations meet agreed expectations. We also support optimisation initiatives where existing data centres are evaluated for efficiency, resilience, and scalability improvements — helping organisations modernise without unnecessary disruption.</p>
